149 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 119 0 R/E(Welcome to 2211 Lillie! We\220re longtime Santa Barbara locals and have always loved Summerland for its laid-back coastal feel, beautiful beaches, and easy access to Santa Barbara and Montecito. We wanted this home to be a place our family and friends could enjoy, and we\220re excited to share it with you as well.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

150 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 119 0 R/E(We\220ve included some of our favorite local restaurants, beaches, walks and things to do in this guide. We hope you enjoy the house and this special little corner of the coast as much as we do.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

151 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 119 0 R/E(Check-in begins at 3:00pm. If you arrive early, please contact us and we\220ll let you know whether the home is ready. )/Pg 11 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

