<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 120 0 R/T(Parking)/E(Parking)/Pg 12 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

154 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R/E(The property has parking for up to four cars. The smaller parking area by the lower driveway is tight, so guests should park carefully and stay off the grass. Overnight parking is also available on Lillie Avenue just down the hill, subject to availability. A Tesla car charger may be available for guest use. Please contact us to arrange. )/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 120 0 R/T(Heating & AC)/E(Heating & AC)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R/E(The home has central heat and air conditioning. A Nest thermostat is located in the main house near the upstairs couch. Tap the thermostat to turn it on, use the dial to adjust the temperature, and press the display to select the appropriate setting.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

157 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R/E(The casita has a mini-split AC unit operated by remote. Please make sure the unit is set to AC/Cool mode when using it.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

158 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 120 0 R/T(Sonos)/E(Sonos)/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

159 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R/E(The home has two Sonos speakers: one upstairs and one in the media room. Connect your device to the Wi-Fi network and open the Sonos app to select the speaker you would like to use.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

160 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 120 0 R/T(Trash & Recycling)/E(Trash & Recycling)/Pg 12 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

161 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 120 0 R/E(The kitchen has separate trash and recycling compartments. Extra bags are available beneath the sink. Outdoor bins are located by the lower entrance near the garage. Neighborhood collection is Friday morning.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

